"The autodoc detected a bacterial infection in <npcname>'s body, but as it "
"also detected they've already taken antibiotics, it decided not to apply "
"another dose right now."
msgstr ""
"Автодок обнаружил бактериальную инфекцию в организме NPC (<npcname>), но "
